{"kind": "finding", "id": "F-ghost-playback-015-01", "file": "Source/Parsek.Tests/GhostPartEventApplyLogTests.cs", "line": 158, "method": "TheNumbersAreInvariantFormatted_UnderACommaDecimalCulture", "category": "T1", "severity": "Low", "confidence": "high", "falsifiability": "falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GhostPartEventApplyLog.cs:213; drop CultureInfo.InvariantCulture from FormatLine -> still green, so no production change reds this test", "what_it_asserts": "Under de-DE, FormatLine renders rec/pid/applied/skipped with no comma and no dot.", "why_weak": "Every formatted argument is an int or uint; de-DE formats those identically to invariant (no group separator on the default numeric format), so the InvariantCulture argument the name pins is not exercised.", "proposed_action": "Either add a formatted double/float token to the line grammar and assert it under de-DE, or retitle the test to what it does prove (the token order and spelling of the numeric fields) and drop the culture framing.", "effort": "S", "july_ref": "none"}
{"kind": "finding", "id": "F-ghost-playback-015-02", "file": "Source/Parsek.Tests/PlaybackTraceTests.cs", "line": 166, "method": "Reset_ClearsCacheAndTraceState", "category": "T3", "severity": "Medium", "confidence": "high", "falsifiability": "falsifiability: Source/Parsek/PlaybackTrace.cs:129; delete traceStates.Clear() from Reset() -> still green", "what_it_asserts": "After PlaybackTrace.Reset(), CachedRecordingCountForTesting is 0 and the cached structural-event UT list for the recording id is null.", "why_weak": "The name and the production doc comment (PlaybackTrace.cs:62-66) claim Reset also clears per-ghost trace cursors so a respawned ghost does not inherit a stale pose or a stale completed-event set, but no assertion reads GetLastTracedEventUTForTesting or IsEventCompletedForTesting after the Reset.", "proposed_action": "After Reset(), assert double.IsNaN(GetLastTracedEventUTForTesting(\"rec-reset\", 0)) and IsEventCompletedForTesting(\"rec-reset\", 0, 10.0) == false.", "effort": "S", "july_ref": "none"}
{"kind": "coverage", "sut": "PlaybackTrace", "sut_file": "Source/Parsek/PlaybackTrace.cs", "sut_line": 126, "case_kind": "state-transition", "proposed_name": "Reset_ClearsPerGhostTraceCursorAndCompletedEventSet", "sketch": "Emit an in-window frame plus a gate-closed frame for (rec, ghost 0) so lastTracedEventUT is set and the event is retired; call Reset(); assert GetLastTracedEventUTForTesting is NaN and IsEventCompletedForTesting is false; then re-emit the same in-window frame and assert one fresh line is emitted with dM=0.00.", "guards": "Catches a Reset() that clears only structuralEventUTCache, which would leave a respawned ghost with a stale previous pose (bogus dM/dSpd) and a permanently suppressed event window.", "risk": "playback"}
